# Hintforge corpus .gitignore -- DENY-BY-DEFAULT.
# Generated by corpus-deploy from nav/architecture.md `vector-extensions:`.
# Nothing ships unless whitelisted below. User state/setup and dev scaffolding
# are excluded by NOT being listed -- the skill never has to predict them.
*
!.gitignore
!*/

# --- Fixed spine (universal core per docs/corpus-format.md) ---
# NOTE: CHECKPOINT.md is universal core too, but is DELIBERATELY excluded here --
# it is per-user playthrough state (player name, save slots, dials). Do not add it.
!nav/**
!architecture_manifest.md
!items/**
!sections/**
!_overflow/**
!achievements.md
!controls.md
!dependencies.md
!limitations.md
!mechanics.md
!persona.md
!settings.md
!warning_tiers.md
!CLAUDE.md
!AGENTS.md
!DISCLAIMER.md

# --- README storefront + status-card assets (flash-thumbnail/status-card convention, 2026-08-21) ---
# corpus-deploy should generate these whitelist lines going forward (framework fix owed).
!README.md
!assets/**

# --- Interactive artifacts (self-contained player tools, 2026-09-16) ---
# Presentation/tooling, NOT corpus the reader loads -- so whitelisted here rather
# than declared as a vector-extension in the manifest. The authoring template
# (artifacts/*.template.html) is re-excluded below: it carries build scaffolding,
# not a tool a player opens.
!artifacts/*.html
artifacts/*.template.html
!artifacts/README.md
# Save importer kit (corpus-deploy "tool that reads the player's own save" rule,
# 2026-10-17): a stranger can run it on their own save, so it ships with exactly
# the files it needs. The template is re-included because the rebuild needs it.
# data/save_state.json (one player's import) and the dev-only
# build_planner_data.py / gap_report.md stay out.
!artifacts/build_planner.template.html
!artifacts/data/
artifacts/data/*
!artifacts/data/talents.json
!extract_tools/
extract_tools/*
!extract_tools/save_import.py
!extract_tools/build_artifact.py
!extract_tools/test_save_import.py
!extract_tools/blueprint_names.json

# --- Declared vector-extensions (one !<ext>/** per manifest entry) ---
!puzzles/**
!npcs/**
!endings/**
!paths/**
!crew/**
!factions/**
